{"id":"6a106e13e61c6d28","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/514_Lewis_模态逻辑_S_2.md","title":"514 Lewis 模态逻辑 S 2","display":"514_Lewis_模态逻辑_S_2","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号与缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\Rightarrow_s B:=\\Box(A\\to B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\Rightarrow_s B:=\\Box(A\\to B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{514}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{514})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{514}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{514})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{514}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。无绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{514}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{514}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,514}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,514}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{514}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{514}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,514}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,514}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{514}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{514}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{514}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{514}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{514}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{514}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{514}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{514}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{514}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{514}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{514}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>假常元、正规分配与反身公理族分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{514}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{514}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PCProof}_{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{PCProof}_{514}\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(B_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{514}\">\\(B_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{514}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{514}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k=(B_j\\to C)\">\\(B_k=(B_j\\to C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i=C\">\\(B_i=C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>命题重言式实例公理族定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PC}^{514}\n=\n\\left\\{\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}:\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\rho=(B_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{PCProof}_{514}\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\land B_{m-1}=A\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PC}^{514}\n=\n\\left\\{\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}:\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\rho=(B_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{PCProof}_{514}\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\land B_{m-1}=A\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PC}^{514}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PC}^{514}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>允许受限必然化的公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>定义前提元组载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{0}=\\{()\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{0}=\\{()\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.1-分离规则\">6.1 分离规则</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.2-受限必然化规则\">6.2 受限必然化规则</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}}{\\Box A}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}}{\\Box A}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这是零前提规则，形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\n=\n\\{((),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\n=\n\\{((),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.3-Becker-规则\">6.3 Becker 规则</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Box(A\\to B)}{\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Box(A\\to B)}{\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\n=\n\\{((\\Box(A\\to B)),\\ \\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\n=\n\\{((\\Box(A\\to B)),\\ \\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{514}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{rN}^{514}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\Box B\">\\(A_i=\\Box B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\">\\(((),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{514}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{514}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{514}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{514}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{514}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{514}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{514}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{514}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{514}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{514}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{514}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目采用 Lewis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S2\">\\(S2\\)</span> 的 Lemmon 型非正规公理化。其目标增量由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{514}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{514}\\)</span>、只对公理开放的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514}\\)</span> 与定理级 Becker 规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{514}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它没有把 Becker 规则内部化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(A\\to B)\\to\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\">\\(\\Box(A\\to B)\\to\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\)</span> 公理，也没有采用从任意定理出发的完整必然化。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LewisS2}_{514}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{514},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,514},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{514},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{514},\n\\vdash_{514}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LewisS2}_{514}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{514},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{514},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{514},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,514},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{514},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{rN}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{BR}^{514},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{514},\n\\vdash_{514}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含模态框架、可达关系、赋值、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.1-分离规则","text":"6.1 分离规则","level":2},{"id":"6.2-受限必然化规则","text":"6.2 受限必然化规则","level":2},{"id":"6.3-Becker-规则","text":"6.3 Becker 规则","level":2},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{514}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{b